Dear Colleagues
Dear Colleagues,

We invite you to celebrate the publication of the first issue of 
the International Journal of Multimedia Information Retrieval (IJMIR) 
with us. You as an academic, industrial researcher or practitioner 
involved with multimedia search, exploration will find IJMIR 
to be an essential source for important results in your field. 

